// Box

/*
Factory for a row or column of canvas controls.
newV and newH return a Container.
*/
:doc Box

/*
Create a vertical stack from a List of canvas controls.
( objs:List -- box:Container )
*/
:doc Box#newV

/*
Create a horizontal row from a List of canvas controls.
( objs:List -- box:Container )
*/
:doc Box#newH
